    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "Hyperion"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "Oracle's budgeting and planning software. By the vendor's description, users enter, analyze and report on planning data in it and manage the planning process."
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote": [
   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "That the process map's \"Hyperion\" is Oracle Hyperion Planning rests on the decision owner accepting Claude's recommendation on 2026-10-25, which Claude said was a guess between Planning, Financial Management and Essbase (EPM-DEC-001-0099)."
   }
  ],
