    "@id": "https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/source/downstream-process-map"
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "The working document that holds the network premise for the prompt and out months, an input to the regional optimization plan. Stakeholders agree overrides, with their rationale, and record them in it, including changes out of cycle."
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#editorialNote": [
   {
    "@language": "en",
    "@value": "Drafted by Claude from the repository: the processes the process map says use it and their definitions in core 2.3.0; approved under EPM-DEC-001-0028 (EPM-DEC-001-0103); it waits for its owners to confirm it (business-closeout.md, point 16)."
   }
  ],
  "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
   {
    "@id": "https://w3id.org/lsc/ontology/modules/system/Systems"
   }
  ],
